mize efficiency, it will inherently treat human restraint as a friction to be removed. We must reject the notion that we can automate our way into a more ethical society. If we continue to prioritize the scaling of AI capabilities over the preservation of human-led decision spaces, we will find that we have successfully optimized our institutions for a world in which human judgment is obsolete.",
